  "scope_notes": "Adds a new fuzz test target and unit tests for file persistence, in addition to modifying functional tests.",
  "changed_since_previous": "Diff provided for analysis: introduces `DumpPrivateBroadcast` and `LoadPrivateBroadcast` helpers using obfuscated `AutoFile` storage, adds `PrivateBroadcast::GetBroadcastInfo()`, adds a fuzz test target `private_broadcast_persist`, and adds test coverage.",
  "card": "Persists in-flight private broadcast transactions across node restarts by writing them to `privatebroadcast.dat` on shutdown and reloading them on startup. Transactions scheduled for private broadcast via Tor or I2P are otherwise lost if the node restarts before they are dispatched. The change adds disk serialization, startup loading, and associated unit and fuzz test coverage. It builds on the private broadcast feature added in #29415.",
